        "nobel_worthiness": "The recollision model gave a striking, broadly useful account of strong-field phenomena and supplied the physical foundation for high-harmonic generation and attosecond science.",
        "attribution": "Corkum's three-step picture and the complementary theoretical work of Schafer and Lewenstein make a compelling trio, though the field developed through many groups.",
